{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1379139-what-more-would-you-like-to-see-of-for-demon-the-descent","id":1379139,"title":"What more would you like to see of for Demon the Descent?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-06T19:20:28-07:00","id":1379139,"title":"What more would you like to see of for Demon the Descent?","content":"I\u2019m working on some materials for my current home game and in the past I\u2019ve written up material for Infrastructure, Angels, Cryptids, etc... And right now with being stuck at home I\u2019ve become inspired to work on some more homebrew material and maybe reference material for people. <br /> <br /> I\u2019m no expert in DTD, but my hope is to help make it easier for people to get into the game.<br /> <br /> Anything people wish there was more for DTD?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25291-donteatrawhagis","name":"DontEatRawHagis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"211"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-07T12:52:24-07:00","id":1379304,"title":"","content":"I would like to see more on Angels. It mentions in the DSG I think about Exiles creating custom Numina. Some of those. Also, Angelic forms. There are no rules on these so that would definitely be helpful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14512-ghostdriver","name":"Ghostdriver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14512_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-08T17:26:39-07:00","id":1379555,"title":"","content":"I want to see examples of the Crunch: A battle between a Demon and an Angel, or an entire scouting operation of some Infrastructure by a pair of Demons. I want to see all the rolls worked out and the interactions of the mechanics explicitly documented. I want to see several different Pacts documented with their costs, and two or three examples of a Demon constructing a gadget, again with all of the numbers explained. <br /> <br /> I want examples of Ephemerals and their Influences, with an explanation of what the different levels of Influence mean concretely. Why is <i>this</i> a three dot Influence and not two or four?<br /> <br /> Angels have Numina, Influence, Incepts and for all I know, brass knuckles. Give an example of three Hunters capturing a Demon. <br /> <br /> I want to see a Cover crafted from Pacts. <br /> <br /> I want to see an example of a Cover slowly destroyed by a Hunter by accident or an Angel by choice, with all of the rolls explained.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24502-kieranmullen","name":"KieranMullen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-08T19:34:38-07:00","id":1379580,"title":"","content":"Exiles becoming demons I guess. Incredibly rare. But its improbable, not impossible","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/s